WEBVTT

01:18.670 --> 01:21.960
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.990 --> 01:24.850
[Episode 4]

01:25.460 --> 01:28.380
[Fire Hydrant]

01:25.960 --> 01:26.920
Hurry, come on.

01:28.480 --> 01:29.310
Did you bring the passport?

01:29.310 --> 01:30.840
It's inside, right inside.

01:31.050 --> 01:32.050
Let me take a look.

01:32.080 --> 01:33.520
Don't check it here.

01:34.000 --> 01:35.280
Don't do it here.

01:35.310 --> 01:36.380
Just one look.

01:37.560 --> 01:38.950
That is really important.

01:38.950 --> 01:41.280
-Can help me find it? Let me check.
-I'm searching this one, this bag.

01:41.280 --> 01:43.539
You search that one. Leave this one to me.

01:50.570 --> 01:51.520
It's right inside.

01:51.520 --> 01:53.020
You can go back and find it.

02:05.870 --> 02:07.210
Look at you.

02:07.370 --> 02:08.610
Your acting was so terrible,

02:08.610 --> 02:09.840
and I had to play along with you.

02:09.840 --> 02:12.370
I just wanted to see
what on earth you're up to.

02:14.000 --> 02:14.840
And you.

02:16.880 --> 02:18.560
Even though we broke up, you can still

02:18.560 --> 02:20.480
come back to take your things aboveboard.

02:20.480 --> 02:24.010
Why do you have to judge a gentleman
by your own petty standards?

02:25.800 --> 02:28.430
I just can't stand your arrogant look.

02:28.540 --> 02:30.470
You really think you're a big shot?

02:30.920 --> 02:33.240
You're already so poor
that you have to rent a place to live in.

02:33.240 --> 02:34.970
What are you so arrogant about?

02:39.990 --> 02:42.720
If I wasn't poor,
how could I see your true colors?

02:43.700 --> 02:46.030
Aren't you leaving just because I'm poor?

02:48.260 --> 02:49.680
Li Yifei, after all these years,

02:49.680 --> 02:51.480
how can you still be so childish?

02:51.650 --> 02:54.579
In a relationship, it's either for money
or for love.

02:54.680 --> 02:56.840
There should at least be
one of them, right?

02:56.840 --> 02:58.120
You gave me neither financial

02:58.120 --> 02:59.400
nor emotional support.

02:59.400 --> 03:01.000
Why would I still be with you?

03:09.130 --> 03:11.570
Besides, I love money. So what?

03:12.300 --> 03:14.030
I've never hidden that.

03:14.130 --> 03:16.070
Who doesn't like money?

03:17.500 --> 03:18.970
Look at your status quo.

03:19.310 --> 03:21.370
You still want to defeat your father?

03:22.040 --> 03:25.370
Listen, there's no way
you will ever defeat him in your life.

03:29.200 --> 03:30.040
Stop there.

03:34.620 --> 03:36.020
Gui Lili, remember this.

03:38.210 --> 03:40.010
It's not you breaking up with me.

03:41.560 --> 03:44.160
It's me who decided
to let you go a long time ago.

03:48.320 --> 03:49.880
Originally,
I wanted to bring it up with you

03:49.880 --> 03:51.680
before renting this apartment.

03:52.140 --> 03:53.780
But I thought I'd rent the apartment,

03:53.780 --> 03:54.980
get you settled down,

03:55.730 --> 03:58.530
and wait until you had a place to stay
before I left.

03:59.140 --> 04:00.520
But unexpectedly,

04:00.520 --> 04:02.380
you used all the money to buy bags.

04:09.520 --> 04:11.610
Yesterday, I scraped together
over 100,000 yuan with my buddies.

04:11.610 --> 04:12.810
It's all in this card.

04:13.220 --> 04:14.730
The password is your birthday.

04:14.730 --> 04:16.540
[It's dangerous to pile up stuff
in the corridor.]

04:20.570 --> 04:22.300
Don't spend it on bags anymore.

04:23.320 --> 04:24.980
Find yourself a proper place.

04:26.280 --> 04:29.280
Maybe that guy surnamed Niu
can give you a better life.

04:29.310 --> 04:30.270
But remember,

04:30.860 --> 04:32.659
you must have a place of your own.

04:32.770 --> 04:35.080
[It's dangerous to pile up stuff
in the corridor.]

04:34.600 --> 04:36.860
In case he treats you badly in the future,

04:39.450 --> 04:42.180
at least you won't be left
without a place to stay.

04:45.550 --> 04:47.770
You never suffered
any mistreatment with me,

04:47.770 --> 04:50.370
so don't swallow your pride
with someone else.

04:53.640 --> 04:55.970
Alright, one last piece of advice for you.

04:57.780 --> 04:59.780
Only when you value yourself enough

05:00.690 --> 05:02.490
will others not look down on you.

05:12.360 --> 05:13.160
Goodbye.

05:14.830 --> 05:19.460
[No piling on public stairs]

05:22.170 --> 05:23.510
[No piling on public stairs]

06:14.040 --> 06:15.770
What can relieve my worries?

06:16.770 --> 06:18.990
It's endless work!

06:20.050 --> 06:21.060
Come on.

06:37.280 --> 06:38.080
Open the door.

06:41.480 --> 06:42.320
What's up?

06:42.760 --> 06:44.000
I made breakfast.

06:50.680 --> 06:51.880
You actually made it?

06:52.170 --> 06:52.810
Yeah.

06:55.840 --> 06:56.440
Thanks.

06:57.060 --> 06:57.720
No problem.

06:58.060 --> 06:58.860
Wait a minute.

07:03.280 --> 07:04.880
Don't you think your house is

07:05.170 --> 07:07.770
a bit jinxed
(sounds like slanted in Chinese)?

07:08.100 --> 07:10.240
Slanted? No, it's pretty straight.

07:10.260 --> 07:11.390
Where is it slanted?

07:12.660 --> 07:14.220
I meant jinxed.

07:16.670 --> 07:17.230
What...

07:17.690 --> 07:20.570
Look, when you just got the house,

07:21.680 --> 07:23.740
you broke up with your ex-boyfriend.

07:26.240 --> 07:27.440
As soon as I moved in,

07:29.460 --> 07:30.720
Gui Lili and I broke up.

07:32.480 --> 07:33.540
Isn't that jinxed?

07:37.340 --> 07:40.270
Now that you put it this way,
it does seem a bit jinxed.

07:40.680 --> 07:42.440
Should I find someone
to cleanse the place?

07:42.440 --> 07:43.840
Human will conquers all!

07:44.070 --> 07:46.200
Stop with the supernatural nonsense.

07:46.400 --> 07:48.460
Weren't you the one who brought it up?

08:02.250 --> 08:03.030
Boss,

08:03.060 --> 08:05.320
I have organized the classified materials

08:05.320 --> 08:06.440
of Shanlifang Hotel Group

08:06.440 --> 08:07.390
and sent them to your email.

08:07.390 --> 08:08.090
I received them.

08:08.090 --> 08:11.490
[Microphone on] [Speaker on] [Camera on]

08:08.160 --> 08:10.560
There's one thing
I still can't figure out.

08:11.010 --> 08:11.580
Go ahead.

08:11.760 --> 08:12.750
He Jing is already

08:12.750 --> 08:14.380
working on these materials.

08:14.400 --> 08:16.080
The data is provided by Shanlifang.

08:16.080 --> 08:17.920
Why not just use He Jing's result?

08:17.920 --> 08:19.320
Aren't we doing

08:19.550 --> 08:21.010
repetitive work this way?

08:22.360 --> 08:23.440
Then do you think

08:24.190 --> 08:26.450
Shanlifang's IPO normally

08:26.950 --> 08:28.440
is complex enough

08:28.890 --> 08:30.620
to call for joint sponsorship?

08:31.270 --> 08:32.799
Despite its large fundraising amount,

08:32.799 --> 08:33.590
He Jing

08:33.590 --> 08:35.429
does not hold any equity in Shanlifang

08:35.429 --> 08:37.690
and can completely underwrite it alone.

08:37.760 --> 08:38.830
So why do you think

08:39.000 --> 08:41.600
Shanlifang would go through extra expense

08:41.600 --> 08:43.600
and more trouble to do this?

08:45.680 --> 08:46.480
Why?

08:46.940 --> 08:48.670
I'm trying to find out why, too.

08:48.850 --> 08:49.930
All I know is that

08:50.040 --> 08:52.440
a joint sponsorship
won't save me any work.

08:54.070 --> 08:55.320
If Shanlifang wants to complicate things,

08:55.320 --> 08:57.190
there must be a reason for it.

09:05.130 --> 09:06.480
[Project Manager Assistant,
Project Assistant]

09:06.510 --> 09:07.700
[Job Description] [Work Address]

09:31.870 --> 09:32.990
Li Yifei.

09:33.970 --> 09:35.050
Are you okay?

09:40.320 --> 09:41.960
You haven't eaten all day.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.400
Don't scare me.

09:43.430 --> 09:45.750
Don't commit suicide over a breakup.

09:46.200 --> 09:47.650
You are an adult.

09:48.000 --> 09:50.960
You should take responsibility
for your actions, you know?

09:50.960 --> 09:52.160
It's no big deal.

09:53.240 --> 09:54.400
You'll be fine.

10:07.460 --> 10:08.510
Li Yifei!

10:09.670 --> 10:11.060
Just make a peep,

10:13.060 --> 10:14.590
or I have to call the police.

10:14.720 --> 10:16.720
I can't just ignore this anymore.

10:17.600 --> 10:18.200
Peep.

10:19.600 --> 10:21.690
I asked you to peep, and you actually did.

10:21.690 --> 10:23.350
Can't you say a few more words,

10:23.840 --> 10:25.280
so I can confirm

10:25.280 --> 10:27.480
that you're still breathing normally?

10:27.730 --> 10:29.230
Peep, peep, peep.

10:30.880 --> 10:31.670
Fine.

10:32.000 --> 10:35.130
You might have become stupid,
but at least you're alive.

10:47.200 --> 10:48.910
When Chairman Liao asked to see me
in private,

10:48.910 --> 10:51.400
I knew there was something wrong
with Shanlifang.

10:51.400 --> 10:52.300
As expected,

10:52.720 --> 10:55.020
the data they provided
shows inconsistency.

10:55.020 --> 10:58.880
One look at the statements,
and you can tell there's something fishy.

11:00.340 --> 11:01.700
Then why don't you come to the office

11:01.700 --> 11:03.630
so we can investigate it together?

11:03.640 --> 11:06.080
It's better to do this quietly.

11:07.920 --> 11:09.830
You haven't shown up for days.

11:10.120 --> 11:11.390
President Li was anxious,

11:11.390 --> 11:12.340
asking when we would go

11:12.340 --> 11:14.670
to Shanlifang to start the due diligence.

11:14.960 --> 11:17.630
We should know ourselves and the enemy
before stepping into the ring.

11:17.630 --> 11:18.780
It doesn't matter if he's anxious.

11:18.780 --> 11:19.910
I will report to him.

11:20.560 --> 11:23.390
The point is, what's the situation
with Fang Yun now?

11:23.390 --> 11:25.000
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

11:24.840 --> 11:26.400
Don't think I don't know
what you're thinking.

11:25.000 --> 11:26.650
[IPO Analysis Report]

11:27.520 --> 11:29.850
Is it over
just because we got the project?

11:29.920 --> 11:32.400
This is the starting point,
not the finish line!

11:32.400 --> 11:33.460
We can't slack off.

11:34.220 --> 11:35.820
If it still doesn't work out,

11:37.560 --> 11:39.390
I wouldn't mind replacing the whole team.

11:39.390 --> 11:42.300
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

11:48.240 --> 11:50.170
Is there any movement at Zhizhong?

11:50.760 --> 11:53.320
Li Yifei has asked for leave
for 2 consecutive days.

11:53.320 --> 11:55.120
They haven't made any progress.

12:01.490 --> 12:02.620
He's faking it, huh?

12:36.840 --> 12:38.040
Mr. Li Yifei,

12:38.120 --> 12:39.480
I know you're in your room.

12:39.480 --> 12:41.040
You don't need to make a peep.

12:41.040 --> 12:42.080
Well,

12:42.200 --> 12:44.860
I bought groceries.
Let's have lunch together.

12:48.840 --> 12:50.840
If you don't respond,
I'll take it as a yes.

12:50.840 --> 12:51.920
I'll go cook then.

13:03.110 --> 13:06.070
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

13:07.050 --> 13:10.390
♪ You always bump into my little secrets ♪

13:11.590 --> 13:12.950
♪ In my eyebrows and eyelashes ♪

13:13.490 --> 13:15.070
♪ In the curve of my lips, in my hair ♪

13:15.480 --> 13:17.630
♪ Like the raindrops in spring I like ♪

13:18.090 --> 13:19.650
♪ Or the kitten in the afternoon ♪

13:20.360 --> 13:24.060
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

13:24.890 --> 13:28.300
♪ You always arouse my desire
to protect you easily ♪

13:29.250 --> 13:30.370
♪ Seeing through my secret thoughts ♪

13:31.190 --> 13:32.720
♪ My hesitation, and my moody side ♪

13:33.290 --> 13:35.400
♪ Like the beer and fried chicken
in autumn I like ♪

13:34.640 --> 13:35.720
This meal is on me.

13:35.720 --> 13:36.960
You don't need to pay for the groceries.

13:35.950 --> 13:37.350
♪ And the spicy fish in winter ♪

13:37.890 --> 13:41.560
♪ Why is it you again?
In such a sweet tone ♪

13:42.110 --> 13:46.130
♪ It's like the whole world knows
I miss you ♪

13:46.860 --> 13:50.370
♪ Why is it always you?
With a cool chuckle ♪

13:50.930 --> 13:54.680
♪ Let me play along and protect you ♪

13:58.280 --> 13:59.280
Li Yifei!

14:03.320 --> 14:04.380
Check your WeChat!

14:11.440 --> 14:12.340
[You asked me not to make a peep.
Then I can only text you on WeChat.]

14:12.360 --> 14:13.010
[Food for free? I'll eat it.]

14:13.030 --> 14:13.790
[Stop knocking. I'll eat. Just put
the bowls of food in front of the door.]

14:13.810 --> 14:14.660
[I'll beat you up if you knock again.]

14:14.680 --> 14:15.450
[Granny Landlady, are you deaf?
Check your phone.]

14:15.480 --> 14:16.470
[It's so noisy!
You're blowing out my eardrums!]

14:16.490 --> 14:17.520
[Ahhh! Do you even use your phone?
Stop knocking!]

14:19.630 --> 14:20.680
Childish.

14:22.520 --> 14:24.580
Looks like he's still alive and well.

14:37.860 --> 14:41.120
I'll let you eat as much fried eggplant
as you want in one go.

14:59.200 --> 15:00.460
I left the food at your door.

15:00.460 --> 15:01.520
Remember to eat it.

15:44.330 --> 15:45.930
[The fried eggplant is quite good.]

15:45.930 --> 15:47.540
[The scrambled egg
with tomato is too sweet.]

15:59.900 --> 16:02.150
He ate so fast.

16:06.400 --> 16:08.200
The plates and bowl are so clean.

16:09.500 --> 16:11.360
Looks like he had a good appetite.

16:46.510 --> 16:48.620
What did the landlady put
in the food she cooked?

16:48.620 --> 16:50.750
Why do I want more after eating enough?

17:07.950 --> 17:08.880
Long time no see.

17:09.609 --> 17:10.540
Long time no see.

17:17.680 --> 17:18.680
Landlady.

17:19.440 --> 17:20.000
So,

17:21.109 --> 17:21.680
what

17:23.700 --> 17:25.099
are we having for dinner?

17:26.200 --> 17:28.329
Grab whatever you want to eat
from the fridge,

17:28.329 --> 17:29.860
wash it, cut it up,

17:30.400 --> 17:31.460
and leave it there.

17:31.770 --> 17:32.970
I'll cook it tonight.

17:34.310 --> 17:34.920
Wait,

17:36.240 --> 17:37.020
I wash it

17:37.820 --> 17:38.820
and cut it up?

17:38.840 --> 17:39.590
Yes, of course.

17:39.590 --> 17:40.350
You're not a guest.

17:40.350 --> 17:41.420
If you want to eat,

17:41.440 --> 17:42.570
you have to help out.

17:43.010 --> 17:44.440
Well, what about the lunch today...

17:44.440 --> 17:45.680
Today's lunch was an exception.

17:45.680 --> 17:46.690
I was taking care of you.

17:46.690 --> 17:47.900
Since you're fine now,

17:47.900 --> 17:49.500
you can't keep freeloading.

17:50.380 --> 17:51.380
Unbelievable!

17:52.490 --> 17:54.730
Forget it. I'll eat out.

17:54.750 --> 17:55.770
Suit yourself.

17:55.930 --> 17:57.650
Who cares about your food?

18:03.170 --> 18:04.120
I'm eating out.

18:04.820 --> 18:05.630
As you want.

18:05.890 --> 18:06.910
Once I step out this door,

18:06.910 --> 18:08.910
I'm not coming back to eat, you know.

18:16.450 --> 18:17.870
Thank goodness,

18:18.020 --> 18:20.280
he finally went out to get some fresh air.

18:25.210 --> 18:26.800
Of course I have time.

18:26.840 --> 18:27.970
I'll be right there.

18:35.070 --> 18:36.610
Look at Yifei.

18:37.350 --> 18:39.650
He has already had several girlfriends.

18:39.960 --> 18:42.810
What about you?
You haven't had a single one.

18:42.980 --> 18:45.030
When will you bring one girlfriend back

18:45.030 --> 18:46.030
for us to see?

18:46.050 --> 18:46.830
That's right.

18:46.830 --> 18:47.380
Mom,

18:47.400 --> 18:49.980
love has to happen naturally.

18:50.060 --> 18:51.180
I can't drag

18:51.200 --> 18:53.310
a random one back from the street, right?

18:53.310 --> 18:54.120
Oh, boy...

18:54.140 --> 18:55.060
Look how you speak.

18:55.060 --> 18:56.350
When did I ever ask you to drag someone

18:56.350 --> 18:57.190
from the street?

18:57.190 --> 18:57.800
Exactly.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.980
All because you spoiled him!

19:00.980 --> 19:02.850
He's getting more and more rebellious,

19:02.850 --> 19:03.630
honestly.

19:03.650 --> 19:05.810
Mom, how am I rebellious?

19:05.830 --> 19:07.890
I've always listened to you
since I was little.

19:07.890 --> 19:09.280
I listened to you about school.

19:09.280 --> 19:10.920
I listened to you
about extracurricular classes.

19:10.920 --> 19:13.450
Didn't you also arrange my job
after graduation?

19:13.450 --> 19:14.380
Do you expect me

19:14.410 --> 19:15.480
to listen to you all my life?

19:15.480 --> 19:17.100
Is it wrong to listen to your mom?

19:17.100 --> 19:19.160
Did I arrange anything wrong for you?

19:19.660 --> 19:22.020
Look at every step I arranged for you.

19:22.180 --> 19:23.600
Well, tell me

19:23.620 --> 19:24.930
if I made any wrong arrangements.

19:24.930 --> 19:26.090
Yes, yes, you're always right.

19:26.090 --> 19:28.690
Yifei is almost here.
I'll go cook the wontons.

19:28.780 --> 19:30.190
Look at this kid

19:31.100 --> 19:32.330
and his growing rebellion.

19:32.330 --> 19:34.660
Alright, our child has grown up.

19:34.680 --> 19:37.800
Don't oversee every little thing.

19:38.610 --> 19:39.490
Alright.

19:39.590 --> 19:40.850
"Every little thing"?

19:45.020 --> 19:46.210
What brings you here?

19:46.210 --> 19:47.210
I'm exhausted.

19:47.240 --> 19:48.840
Hurry, get me the slippers.

19:49.990 --> 19:51.850
Why did you buy so many groceries?

19:52.120 --> 19:53.920
Because you're such a good cook.

19:54.440 --> 19:56.040
What's wrong with your face?

19:56.790 --> 19:58.390
I forgot to remove my makeup.

19:59.710 --> 20:01.600
Hey, what are you doing?

20:02.610 --> 20:03.460
Darling,

20:04.250 --> 20:05.580
what are you going to do?

20:14.860 --> 20:18.520
Look at all this mess,

20:18.840 --> 20:20.960
filled with monsters and demons.

20:20.990 --> 20:22.120
Oh, really.

20:22.300 --> 20:24.050
What a load of filthy things.

20:24.100 --> 20:25.560
He wastes so much time

20:25.590 --> 20:26.590
on this.

20:26.610 --> 20:28.140
Hey, stop pressing randomly.

20:28.140 --> 20:29.810
It's really toxic.

20:29.020 --> 20:30.520
[Type, Bracelet] [Unload]

20:29.840 --> 20:31.590
What a waste of time.

20:32.330 --> 20:34.240
Don't click randomly.
No more random clicking.

20:34.240 --> 20:36.140
What is this mess?

20:40.100 --> 20:42.100
Someone discarded top-tier items?

20:42.850 --> 20:44.850
Who is benefiting others like this?

20:46.800 --> 20:47.680
[Character: Prime Minister]

20:50.340 --> 20:51.430
Prime Minister?

20:51.900 --> 20:52.590
Look.

20:53.230 --> 20:54.700
Look, there's nothing left.

20:54.700 --> 20:55.490
See?

20:58.570 --> 21:00.370
Mom, Dad, the wontons are ready.

21:03.810 --> 21:05.810
What are you doing with my computer?

21:06.190 --> 21:07.470
N-Nothing.

21:07.910 --> 21:09.580
Just some random pressing.

21:09.600 --> 21:10.560
It's fine.

21:12.260 --> 21:13.200
[Your gear has been taken.]

21:14.370 --> 21:14.800
I...

21:15.680 --> 21:16.080
I...

21:16.100 --> 21:17.160
What are you doing?

21:18.090 --> 21:19.020
Where is my gear?

21:21.310 --> 21:22.300
Pardon?

21:22.840 --> 21:23.800
What gear?

21:23.970 --> 21:27.100
[Prime Minister]

21:26.960 --> 21:27.440
Wait.

21:28.720 --> 21:29.130
I...

21:29.790 --> 21:31.600
Why is all my gear gone?

21:33.240 --> 21:36.240
Where is the gear
I spent over half a year grinding for?

21:38.440 --> 21:40.300
It's just a gaming team.

21:40.550 --> 21:42.520
You can just join another one.

21:44.000 --> 21:45.190
Of course not.

21:45.590 --> 21:47.460
If I could join them,

21:47.720 --> 21:49.780
I would definitely become this, too.

21:51.030 --> 21:53.100
If you want to stand out from the crowd,

21:53.100 --> 21:56.030
you've got to create
your own opportunities, right?

21:56.510 --> 21:57.920
I did create them!

21:58.000 --> 22:00.590
I started trying to grind this account
half a year ago.

22:00.590 --> 22:02.000
It was so close to success.

22:02.000 --> 22:03.110
But then my mom...

22:05.480 --> 22:06.410
ruined it.

22:07.000 --> 22:09.200
Fine, that's all you're good for.

22:10.760 --> 22:11.820
I have no ambition.

22:12.830 --> 22:14.870
My dream and my hobby

22:15.240 --> 22:16.550
are gone forever.

22:17.550 --> 22:19.150
I don't want to live anymore.

22:20.240 --> 22:21.240
You're overreacting.

22:21.240 --> 22:22.310
This is too much.

22:24.030 --> 22:25.590
Thanks, ma'am.

22:26.720 --> 22:28.340
Try this crab.

22:28.960 --> 22:30.620
I'll have the rice cake first.

22:32.110 --> 22:32.720
How is it?

22:33.550 --> 22:34.610
It's so delicious.

22:36.050 --> 22:37.510
It's so comfortable here.

22:37.510 --> 22:38.480
If I were you,

22:38.510 --> 22:39.970
I would sit here every day.

22:40.600 --> 22:42.120
That is a nice dream.

22:42.380 --> 22:44.980
I still have to submit resumes
to look for a job.

22:45.350 --> 22:47.410
Oh, right, how's your job hunt going?

22:48.070 --> 22:50.020
I've applied to dozens of jobs

22:50.070 --> 22:52.000
but only gotten 3 interviews,

22:52.110 --> 22:53.870
and I'm not sure
if any of them will hire me.

22:53.870 --> 22:55.790
If things don't work out, you can go find

22:55.790 --> 22:57.030
some part-time jobs just like me.

22:57.030 --> 23:00.430
You know what? Part-time jobs
earn more than full-time ones.

23:01.960 --> 23:03.840
This shredded potato is so good.

23:03.920 --> 23:05.520
Then have as much as you like.

23:05.680 --> 23:07.750
Pack up all the leftovers for me later.

23:07.750 --> 23:09.680
I love cooking for people like you.

23:14.800 --> 23:15.790
I ate too much and might as well

23:15.790 --> 23:16.990
take a walk down here.

23:17.870 --> 23:19.550
What did you eat?

23:20.360 --> 23:22.360
Are you okay? Still want to throw up?

23:23.760 --> 23:25.320
Isn't that your tenant?

23:25.440 --> 23:25.870
Yes.

23:25.870 --> 23:26.440
Let me clean it up

23:26.440 --> 23:28.370
in case someone files a complaint.

23:28.710 --> 23:30.170
Who's that one next to him?

23:30.690 --> 23:32.220
He must have drunk too much.

23:33.000 --> 23:33.840
Wait a moment.

23:34.170 --> 23:36.220
Aren't you that bartender girl?

23:36.450 --> 23:37.530
Bartender girl?

23:37.550 --> 23:38.200
What's up?

23:38.230 --> 23:39.960
What a coincidence. Why are you here?

23:39.960 --> 23:41.360
It's such a coincidence.

23:41.550 --> 23:42.610
What are you doing?

23:42.790 --> 23:43.930
What a coincidence.

23:57.760 --> 23:59.970
My bestie only

24:00.000 --> 24:01.950
let your friend go for our sakes.

24:02.110 --> 24:03.920
Otherwise, they'd end up
at the police station by now.

24:03.920 --> 24:05.210
He just drank too much alcohol.

24:05.210 --> 24:07.410
Everyone gets drunk sometimes, right?

24:08.550 --> 24:10.010
If he hadn't gotten drunk,

24:10.760 --> 24:12.200
he wouldn't have acted like that

24:12.200 --> 24:13.350
and caused a misunderstanding.

24:13.350 --> 24:15.350
Drunk behavior reveals character.

24:16.750 --> 24:19.300
Sounds as if your drunk behavior is
any better.

24:19.300 --> 24:21.500
I don't know what you're talking about.

24:23.830 --> 24:24.590
By the way,

24:25.110 --> 24:27.200
did you cancel your wedding banquet?

24:29.270 --> 24:31.250
I've been kind enough to you.

24:31.400 --> 24:33.680
Can you stop rubbing salt into the wound?

24:38.350 --> 24:39.480
Originally,

24:39.480 --> 24:41.790
a friend of mine
wanted to hold a dinner party,

24:41.790 --> 24:44.030
so I thought about
transferring yours to him.

24:44.030 --> 24:44.790
Wait, wait.

24:44.790 --> 24:46.190
Since that's the case...

24:46.240 --> 24:47.190
Wait a minute.

24:47.830 --> 24:49.340
So you mean

24:49.480 --> 24:51.410
I can get the deposit back?

24:51.870 --> 24:53.050
If the time is right.

24:53.720 --> 24:55.310
This is a great date!

24:55.400 --> 24:56.730
October 18th!

24:57.930 --> 24:59.860
So your schedules actually match.

25:00.850 --> 25:01.850
Great!

25:03.030 --> 25:04.800
Please, please, please.

25:05.110 --> 25:06.110
I'm counting on you.

25:06.110 --> 25:07.280
Please, please.

25:08.610 --> 25:09.740
It all counts on you.

25:13.200 --> 25:14.200
All right, all right.

25:14.200 --> 25:16.930
Consider it me returning you
the favor for lunch.

25:17.440 --> 25:18.160
We're even.

25:18.240 --> 25:19.830
Okay, we're even!

25:21.270 --> 25:23.510
I can finally get my money back.

25:26.490 --> 25:28.220
You look even drunker than Jun.

25:31.410 --> 25:33.800
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

25:37.680 --> 25:38.290
Ms. Liao.

25:42.930 --> 25:44.860
Still working overtime this late?

25:45.100 --> 25:46.500
I just took over the work.

25:46.540 --> 25:48.480
There are still many things
for me to sort out.

25:48.480 --> 25:50.940
Take a break.
Let's have a late-night snack.

25:51.920 --> 25:52.760
I'll pass.

25:53.240 --> 25:55.170
I still have a lot of work to finish.

25:58.310 --> 26:00.640
Indeed, I shouldn't interrupt your work.

26:01.600 --> 26:02.870
I didn't mean that.

26:04.590 --> 26:05.990
Give me 10 minutes, okay?

26:07.270 --> 26:07.960
Okay.

26:21.080 --> 26:21.710
Please.

26:22.760 --> 26:23.400
Alright.

26:39.340 --> 26:41.340
You've worked so hard for the group.

26:41.400 --> 26:42.860
We can't let you go hungry.

26:44.950 --> 26:45.950
When I was little,

26:46.270 --> 26:48.130
my grandma taught me a principle.

26:48.510 --> 26:49.240
What is it?

26:49.260 --> 26:51.660
She said
only those who truly care about you

26:52.160 --> 26:54.020
would ask if you've had your meal.

26:54.910 --> 26:57.000
If someone cares about you this much,

26:58.340 --> 26:59.740
would you care about her?

27:06.700 --> 27:07.310
I would.

27:11.240 --> 27:11.960
Ruohai,

27:13.600 --> 27:15.930
this is the first time
you've held my hand.

27:19.790 --> 27:22.320
I've been waiting for this day
for a long time.

27:55.550 --> 27:56.680
Are you mute?

28:16.030 --> 28:16.600
Perfect.

28:31.480 --> 28:33.200
Mom, what time is it?

28:33.680 --> 28:34.480
Nine o'clock.

28:35.640 --> 28:37.510
Why didn't you wake me up?
I'm going to be late.

28:37.510 --> 28:39.240
You got totally drunk yesterday,

28:39.240 --> 28:41.170
so I asked for half a day off for you.

28:42.270 --> 28:43.190
Thank you, Mom.

28:45.640 --> 28:47.070
Did you change my clothes?

28:47.070 --> 28:47.790
Yes.

28:48.720 --> 28:50.660
Mom, I'm a grown-up.

28:50.680 --> 28:52.580
Why did you still change my clothes?

28:52.580 --> 28:55.500
I changed your diapers
when you were little.

28:56.240 --> 28:57.640
I have a question for you.

28:58.430 --> 29:00.430
How did you get this shoulder wound?

29:06.000 --> 29:07.960
I slipped and fell last night.

29:09.620 --> 29:10.620
Honestly?

29:10.640 --> 29:11.680
Honestly.

29:12.030 --> 29:12.920
I'm a little hungry.

29:12.920 --> 29:14.240
I want breakfast, Mom.

29:14.760 --> 29:15.640
You want breakfast?

29:15.640 --> 29:18.570
If you can't drink,
don't drink so recklessly again.

29:20.510 --> 29:22.310
Do you want porridge or noodles?

29:22.760 --> 29:24.020
I'll go with porridge.

29:38.440 --> 29:40.020
I'm back again!

29:50.780 --> 29:53.310
You don't have
any receptionist experience.

29:53.430 --> 29:54.820
I'm afraid you don't suit our position

29:54.820 --> 29:56.020
that you applied for.

29:56.200 --> 29:58.350
I don't know how they screened resumes.

29:58.350 --> 30:00.680
Sorry for making you
come all the way here.

30:00.980 --> 30:02.870
With your qualifications,
to work at the front desk,

30:02.870 --> 30:04.030
you'll need a one-year internship.

30:04.030 --> 30:06.830
The base salary is 3,000 yuan.
Is that acceptable?

30:08.070 --> 30:09.330
You are only 27 years old.

30:08.870 --> 30:09.680
[Qian Fei, Personal Information]

30:09.510 --> 30:12.030
In the future, you will get married
and have kids.

30:09.750 --> 30:11.380
[Internship Experience]
[Project Experience]

30:12.110 --> 30:13.920
You might even have a second child.

30:13.920 --> 30:15.110
This will seriously affect your work.

30:15.110 --> 30:16.760
You must sign an agreement
with the company,

30:16.760 --> 30:18.820
promising that you won't get married

30:18.830 --> 30:20.630
or have children within 5 years.

30:39.640 --> 30:40.400
You're an excellent graduate

30:40.400 --> 30:43.400
from the University
of Finance and Economics, right?

30:43.440 --> 30:45.870
Love is neither everlasting

30:46.000 --> 30:47.400
nor unwavering.

30:48.760 --> 30:51.290
And marriage is not
a guarantee for it either.

30:54.160 --> 30:55.570
That is your opinion.

30:56.510 --> 30:59.040
I'm just reminding you
not to waste your life.

31:09.240 --> 31:10.910
[Dear Nalan Maide credit card user:]

31:10.930 --> 31:12.590
[Your credit card ending in 3600]

31:12.620 --> 31:13.970
[has a bill of RMB 2,512.92 yuan.]

31:13.990 --> 31:14.890
[The minimum payment is 1257.57 yuan.]

31:14.910 --> 31:15.950
[Please pay before the 25th.]

31:28.110 --> 31:32.200
What's worse than losing your love
and your job is being in debt.

31:33.910 --> 31:36.150
Pushed by the pending bill,

31:36.350 --> 31:39.000
I've lost the right to choose a job

31:39.480 --> 31:41.400
and am forced to make a living.

32:25.480 --> 32:26.080
Landlady.

32:29.240 --> 32:30.870
I've noticed that you have a skill

32:30.870 --> 32:32.070
that I really admire.

32:32.350 --> 32:32.950
What is it?

32:33.680 --> 32:35.510
You're really good at doing housework.

32:35.510 --> 32:36.770
Have you noticed that?

32:37.180 --> 32:37.620
Look.

32:38.530 --> 32:40.200
There's not a speck of dust.

32:40.270 --> 32:41.670
You're really good at it.

32:45.640 --> 32:46.830
Let's make a deal.

32:47.070 --> 32:47.600
Go ahead.

32:49.140 --> 32:50.270
You help me clean up.

32:52.070 --> 32:53.250
100 yuan per hour.

32:55.270 --> 32:56.000
How about it?

32:56.880 --> 32:57.640
No way.

32:59.680 --> 33:01.080
Is the pay too low for you?

33:01.270 --> 33:04.400
I don't want
another employment relationship with you.

33:05.270 --> 33:06.870
Why would you think that way?

33:07.640 --> 33:09.030
The most equal relationship

33:09.030 --> 33:10.650
in this world is

33:10.720 --> 33:12.400
the employment relationship

33:12.550 --> 33:13.850
built on a contract.

33:14.130 --> 33:15.410
You rent your house to me,

33:15.410 --> 33:16.690
and I hire your labor.

33:17.390 --> 33:19.830
We have an equal and pure relationship.

33:20.030 --> 33:21.660
It's perfect, really.

33:22.360 --> 33:23.030
Right?

33:23.990 --> 33:25.320
Keep talking nonsense.

33:26.980 --> 33:27.620
Look.

33:29.240 --> 33:31.840
You're under huge pressure
to get by right now,

33:32.420 --> 33:33.190
aren't you?

33:34.350 --> 33:36.920
It's so stressful that you don't have
the energy to consider

33:36.920 --> 33:38.640
whether your new job actually suits you

33:38.640 --> 33:40.250
or has any prospects.

33:40.720 --> 33:42.360
You're willing to do anything

33:42.360 --> 33:43.760
just to survive, anyway.

33:45.480 --> 33:46.460
Am I right?

33:49.890 --> 33:52.020
You're pretty good at reading people.

33:53.020 --> 33:55.820
Everyone in investment banking
knows how to read people.

33:55.820 --> 33:58.010
You majored in economics,
so you must know, too.

33:58.010 --> 33:59.410
You should know very well

33:59.490 --> 34:00.740
that being short on money

34:00.740 --> 34:02.700
will cause a person's IQ and EQ

34:02.700 --> 34:03.820
to plummet.

34:05.380 --> 34:06.820
Instead of desperately

34:06.860 --> 34:08.889
submitting resumes to find a job,

34:10.179 --> 34:12.860
you might as well let me hire you.

34:12.929 --> 34:14.679
It's a win-win.

34:14.710 --> 34:15.710
Isn't that great?

34:16.370 --> 34:16.929
Right?

34:17.020 --> 34:19.389
Look at my room. It's so messy.

34:20.489 --> 34:22.570
You're the owner of this house.

34:22.600 --> 34:24.620
Can you bear to see it? Doesn't it hurt?

34:24.620 --> 34:26.260
I'm sure it hurts!

34:27.409 --> 34:28.699
Think about it again.

34:29.139 --> 34:31.409
You can do chores at home

34:31.409 --> 34:32.639
while earning money.

34:34.020 --> 34:35.739
Is there such a good deal anywhere else?

34:35.739 --> 34:37.320
It's way better than being a driver,

34:37.320 --> 34:38.219
a tutor,

34:38.219 --> 34:39.750
or even a bodyguard, right?

34:39.810 --> 34:40.870
You snooped on my computer?

34:40.870 --> 34:42.530
What do you mean by "snooped"?

34:43.050 --> 34:44.199
Your screen was on like this.

34:44.199 --> 34:45.190
I was just walking past it casually,

34:45.190 --> 34:46.280
and I saw it all.

34:49.409 --> 34:50.210
Think it over.

34:50.820 --> 34:52.800
First of all,
thank you for your bluntness.

34:52.800 --> 34:54.620
Finally, I advise you to clean up yourself

34:54.620 --> 34:55.560
to save some rent.

34:55.560 --> 34:57.530
Save up and move out early,

34:57.740 --> 34:59.530
so you don't ruin this house.

35:01.380 --> 35:02.180
That's all?

35:03.220 --> 35:03.740
Wait...

35:04.380 --> 35:04.900
You...

35:05.490 --> 35:06.740
After you said "first of all,"

35:06.740 --> 35:08.340
shouldn't there be a "secondly"
or something?

35:08.340 --> 35:09.930
Why did you skip straight to "finally"?

35:09.930 --> 35:11.060
Because I wanted to!

35:12.410 --> 35:13.970
Think twice.

35:16.340 --> 35:19.340
Isn't cleaning up better
than being a security guard?

35:22.590 --> 35:24.320
Isn't cleaning better than...

35:24.820 --> 35:26.260
Are you stupid?

35:33.740 --> 35:35.780
Have you figured out the cost
to repair the floor?

35:35.780 --> 35:37.180
Tell me, and I'll pay you.

35:38.410 --> 35:39.300
What the heck?

35:39.320 --> 35:42.320
Why send WeChat messages
when we're in the same house?

35:42.320 --> 35:45.720
[Have you figured out the cost to repair
the floor? Tell me, and I'll pay you.]

35:47.010 --> 35:49.410
It looks fine.
No need to repair it for now.

35:50.420 --> 35:51.890
Even if it's not repaired now,

35:51.890 --> 35:54.110
a soaked floor will have
a shorter lifespan.

35:54.110 --> 35:56.040
I'll pay you for the depreciation.

35:57.910 --> 35:58.850
No need.

36:02.800 --> 36:04.530
If I really don't pay,

36:04.560 --> 36:07.160
you'll regret
your fake politeness right now.

36:08.930 --> 36:10.450
I really shouldn't have typed that.

36:10.450 --> 36:12.570
Why be polite to someone like him?

36:20.810 --> 36:21.630
[5,000 yuan for the floor]

36:24.740 --> 36:27.180
I don't like owing people. We're even.

36:37.290 --> 36:37.820
[Receive]

36:37.840 --> 36:39.100
[Loading]

36:41.870 --> 36:42.790
[Payment completed. Bank processing.]

36:52.240 --> 36:52.910
Hello.

36:53.050 --> 36:53.730
Hello.

36:54.480 --> 36:55.820
What would you like to drink?

36:55.820 --> 36:57.830
I came to apologize to you today.

37:00.060 --> 37:01.660
I drank a little too much yesterday.

37:01.660 --> 37:02.870
I'm really sorry.

37:03.590 --> 37:05.440
Although you slammed me down
pretty hard...

37:05.440 --> 37:06.800
If there's nothing else,
I'm getting off work.

37:06.800 --> 37:07.370
Well...

37:10.790 --> 37:12.990
I'd like to order another glass of drink

37:13.100 --> 37:14.500
with milk as the base,

37:14.520 --> 37:16.260
mixed with oat milk, walnut milk,

37:16.260 --> 37:17.480
and many other kinds

37:17.500 --> 37:18.980
of milk.

37:19.630 --> 37:20.780
You remember it quite clearly.

37:20.780 --> 37:21.820
Just a moment.

37:32.440 --> 37:33.770
This drink is on me.

37:33.790 --> 37:35.110
Remember to listen to your mother.

37:35.110 --> 37:37.170
If you can't drink, come to bars less.

37:54.620 --> 37:55.660
I'm sorry.

37:56.020 --> 37:57.180
I know you really hate

37:57.180 --> 37:58.430
bagged bread from the supermarket.

37:58.430 --> 37:59.660
I'll finish it quickly,

37:59.660 --> 38:01.060
so it doesn't bother you.

38:02.530 --> 38:04.270
Isn't your memory a little too good?

38:04.270 --> 38:06.870
You remember
a single sentence for a lifetime?

38:06.940 --> 38:08.610
I do data analysis.

38:09.180 --> 38:11.280
A good memory is
my basic professional skill.

38:11.280 --> 38:14.080
You can't even tell a compliment
from a complaint.

38:16.710 --> 38:18.700
Aren't you switching to the front office?

38:18.700 --> 38:20.890
Why do you still consider yourself
an analyst?

38:20.890 --> 38:22.910
How much did you actually peek at?

38:28.880 --> 38:29.480
By the way,

38:30.770 --> 38:31.820
about the banquet hall,

38:31.820 --> 38:33.390
my buddy said the timing is perfect.

38:33.390 --> 38:34.450
He'll take it over.

38:35.820 --> 38:36.940
T-That's great.

38:36.970 --> 38:38.700
Please thank your buddy for me.

38:41.410 --> 38:42.530
You only thank him?

38:45.760 --> 38:46.650
Thank you, too.

38:47.660 --> 38:48.910
I'll cover our breakfast

38:48.910 --> 38:49.970
for the next month.

38:51.170 --> 38:51.800
Good girl.

38:51.830 --> 38:52.640
Good girl.

38:54.790 --> 38:56.310
This is beautifully made.

38:56.340 --> 38:57.070
Right?

38:58.200 --> 38:59.750
Don't you think it would be more perfect

38:59.750 --> 39:00.960
with a cup of coffee?

39:15.860 --> 39:17.120
You're so thoughtful!

39:18.510 --> 39:19.640
Impressive.

39:21.660 --> 39:23.440
Make it strong. I want it strong.

39:23.440 --> 39:25.500
I'll wait to have it with your coffee.

39:27.460 --> 39:29.560
No sugar, no milk.

39:36.160 --> 39:38.080
Make it as strong as possible.

40:08.090 --> 40:10.810
Firstly, take a sip of coffee.

40:20.930 --> 40:23.750
I think you'll have a bright future
as a barista, too.

40:23.750 --> 40:26.900
Look, I have a friend who runs a cafe.

40:26.930 --> 40:28.590
I can introduce you, okay?

40:28.740 --> 40:29.200
No need.

40:29.530 --> 40:30.630
I've already decided that

40:30.630 --> 40:33.230
I'll only look for jobs
in investment banking.

40:34.860 --> 40:36.120
You learn fast from me!

40:36.700 --> 40:37.820
Stop pretending.

40:38.050 --> 40:40.310
You really know how to flatter yourself.

40:40.490 --> 40:41.090
But

40:41.890 --> 40:43.780
if you switch to the front office now,

40:43.780 --> 40:44.970
your age is...

40:48.580 --> 40:50.890
You're starting a bit late, you know?

40:52.480 --> 40:53.570
But it should be fine.

40:53.570 --> 40:55.290
You're quite tall.

40:55.740 --> 40:57.270
It's not totally hopeless.

40:57.700 --> 40:58.560
How about this?

41:00.890 --> 41:02.890
As long as you take me as your teacher,

41:02.890 --> 41:03.300
I will...

41:03.300 --> 41:03.820
No need.

41:04.660 --> 41:06.890
I already have a role model.

41:07.410 --> 41:08.940
She's much better than you.

41:09.860 --> 41:10.530
Who is it?

41:12.820 --> 41:14.450
Of course, it's Director Fang Yun

41:14.450 --> 41:16.570
who leads in the underwriting amount,

41:16.570 --> 41:18.430
fees, and raised funds in He Jing.

41:22.090 --> 41:23.830
You see Fang Yun as your role model?

41:23.830 --> 41:24.480
Yes.

41:25.110 --> 41:27.330
Not only does she boast
strong professional skills,

41:27.330 --> 41:29.890
but she also has great professionalism.

41:29.920 --> 41:33.120
She's much better
than Huang Shusong from your Zhizhong.

41:33.140 --> 41:34.820
I think they are much the same.

41:34.840 --> 41:36.700
Neither is better than the other.

41:36.970 --> 41:38.930
That's going too far, Li Yifei.

41:38.950 --> 41:40.270
You don't need to twist the facts

41:40.270 --> 41:41.500
just to belittle me.

41:42.200 --> 41:44.140
If you really want
to follow Fang Yun's lead,

41:44.140 --> 41:45.870
why don't you go back to He Jing?

41:46.450 --> 41:49.430
Well, do you think I can go back
just because I want to?

41:53.700 --> 41:54.970
You left He Jing

41:54.990 --> 41:57.020
because its back office had layoffs.

41:57.020 --> 41:59.410
It's not like you were fired
for making mistakes.

41:59.410 --> 42:00.490
If you want to go back,

42:00.490 --> 42:01.780
just apply for a job
in another department,

42:01.780 --> 42:02.340
right?

42:02.370 --> 42:03.890
As long as Fang Yun wants you,

42:03.890 --> 42:05.620
no one can say a word against it.

42:41.000 --> 42:41.390
[Contact]

42:41.420 --> 42:42.050
[Director Fang]

42:43.050 --> 42:44.660
As a former employee,

42:44.660 --> 42:47.050
it wouldn't be appropriate
for me to call her directly.

42:47.050 --> 42:48.260
I'd better wait for her here

42:48.260 --> 42:49.660
and talk to her in person.

42:52.450 --> 42:53.680
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

43:01.220 --> 43:01.860
Don't scream! It's me!

43:01.860 --> 43:03.070
It's me!

43:03.620 --> 43:04.170
It's so noisy!

43:04.170 --> 43:05.420
Let me sleep!

43:05.450 --> 43:06.570
What a crappy door.

43:06.570 --> 43:08.100
It's not soundproof at all.

43:09.660 --> 43:12.520
Landlady, it's early in the morning.
Why are you...

43:14.090 --> 43:15.620
I know what you're here for.

43:16.780 --> 43:17.420
What?

43:17.570 --> 43:19.700
You don't want to stay
in your comfort zone anymore?

43:19.700 --> 43:20.820
Just give up.
